  "releaseNotes": "Added standardized OpenTelemetry-shaped telemetry: a \"Watson\" Meter and ActivitySource emit HTTP server metrics (http.server.request.duration, active_requests, request/response body size) and per-request Server spans with W3C context propagation, plus watson.* metrics for connections, routing, auth, exceptions, and WebSockets. Configure via Settings.Telemetry. Includes forwarded-header (X-Forwarded-For) client-address resolution for spans and an optional in-process Prometheus scrape endpoint served on the existing listener (no extra port).",
